WEBVTT

00:00:02.248 --> 00:00:03.818
AND FORGET TO LIVE.

00:00:22.228 --> 00:00:24.099
[SCREECHES]

00:00:58.612 --> 00:01:01.180
I HAD YOU LOOKING
IN THE WRONG SECTION.

00:01:01.224 --> 00:01:04.749
HOW COULD I BE
SO STUPID?

00:01:04.792 --> 00:01:06.403
I CHECKED THIS OUT
WEEKS AGO

00:01:06.446 --> 00:01:07.447
FOR A BIT
OF LIGHT READING.

00:01:07.491 --> 00:01:10.189
THIS IS LIGHT?

00:01:14.367 --> 00:01:16.891
OF COURSE, HERE IT IS!

00:01:16.935 --> 00:01:19.590
NICHOLAS FLAMEL IS
THE ONLY KNOWN MAKER

00:01:19.633 --> 00:01:21.331
OF THE PHILOSOPHER'S STONE.

00:01:21.374 --> 00:01:22.810
THE WHAT?
THE WHAT?

00:01:22.854 --> 00:01:25.204
HONESTLY,
DON'T YOU TWO READ?

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:28.294
"THE PHILOSOPHER'S STONE

00:01:28.338 --> 00:01:31.079
"IS A LEGENDARY SUBSTANCE
WITH ASTONISHING POWERS.

00:01:31.123 --> 00:01:33.821
"IT CAN TRANSFORM
ANY METAL INTO PURE GOLD

00:01:33.865 --> 00:01:35.954
"AND PRODUCES
THE ELIXIR OF LIFE,

00:01:35.997 --> 00:01:37.956
WHICH WILL MAKE
THE DRINKER IMMORTAL."

00:01:37.999 --> 00:01:38.957
IMMORTAL?

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:40.654
IT MEANS YOU'LL NEVER DIE.

00:01:40.698 --> 00:01:41.655
I KNOW WHAT IT MEANS!

00:01:41.699 --> 00:01:43.048
SHH!

00:01:43.091 --> 00:01:46.921
"THE ONLY STONE CURRENTLY
IN EXISTENCE BELONGS

00:01:46.965 --> 00:01:49.924
"TO MR. NICHOLAS FLAMEL,
THE NOTED ALCHEMIST,

00:01:49.968 --> 00:01:55.452
WHO LAST YEAR CELEBRATED
HIS 665th BIRTHDAY."

00:01:55.495 --> 00:01:57.497
THAT'S WHAT FLUFFY'S
GUARDING ON THE THIRD FLOOR.

00:01:57.541 --> 00:01:59.325
THAT'S WHAT'S
UNDER THE TRAPDOOR--

00:01:59.369 --> 00:02:00.631
THE PHILOSOPHER'S STONE.

00:02:14.862 --> 00:02:18.257
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

00:02:18.301 --> 00:02:19.345
HAGRID!

00:02:19.389 --> 00:02:20.390
OH, HELLO.

00:02:20.433 --> 00:02:21.869
SORRY, DON'T WISH
TO BE RUDE,

00:02:21.913 --> 00:02:23.262
BUT I'M IN NO FIT STATE
TO ENTERTAIN TODAY.

00:02:23.306 --> 00:02:25.438
All: WE KNOW ABOUT
THE PHILOSOPHER'S STONE!

00:02:27.005 --> 00:02:28.833
OH.

00:02:31.009 --> 00:02:32.445
WE THINK SNAPE'S
TRYING TO STEAL IT.

00:02:32.489 --> 00:02:34.404
SNAPE? BLIMEY,
YOU'RE NOT STILL ON

00:02:34.447 --> 00:02:35.840
ABOUT HIM, ARE YOU?

00:02:35.883 --> 00:02:37.755
HAGRID, WE KNOW
HE'S AFTER THE STONE.

00:02:37.798 --> 00:02:39.017
WE JUST DON'T KNOW WHY.

00:02:39.060 --> 00:02:40.801
SNAPE IS ONE
OF THE TEACHERS

00:02:40.845 --> 00:02:42.194
PROTECTING THE STONE.

00:02:42.237 --> 00:02:43.195
HE'S NOT ABOUT
TO STEAL IT.

00:02:43.238 --> 00:02:44.805
WHAT?

00:02:44.849 --> 00:02:46.329
YOU HEARD.

00:02:46.372 --> 00:02:48.461
RIGHT. COME ON NOW.
I'M A BIT PREOCCUPIED TODAY.

00:02:48.505 --> 00:02:51.464
Harry: WAIT A MINUTE.
ONE OF THE TEACHERS?

00:02:51.508 --> 00:02:53.423
OF COURSE! THERE ARE
OTHER THINGS

00:02:53.466 --> 00:02:55.468
DEFENDING THE STONE,
AREN'T THERE?

00:02:55.512 --> 00:02:56.817
SPELLS,
ENCHANTMENTS.

00:02:56.861 --> 00:02:58.341
THAT'S RIGHT.

00:02:58.384 --> 00:03:01.648
WASTE OF BLOODY TIME,
IF YOU ASK ME.

00:03:01.692 --> 00:03:04.042
AIN'T NO ONE GONNA
GET PAST FLUFFY.

00:03:04.085 --> 00:03:05.348
AIN'T A SOUL KNOWS HOW,

00:03:05.391 --> 00:03:07.785
EXCEPT FOR ME
AND DUMBLEDORE.

00:03:07.828 --> 00:03:09.177
I SHOULDN'T HAVE
TOLD YOU THAT.

00:03:09.221 --> 00:03:10.353
I SHOULD NOT HAVE
TOLD YOU THAT.

00:03:10.396 --> 00:03:12.746
[POT RATTLING]

00:03:15.793 --> 00:03:17.969
OH! OOH! OH!

00:03:18.012 --> 00:03:20.624
OOH! OOH! OOH!

00:03:24.671 --> 00:03:26.286
UH, HAGRID,
WHAT EXACTLY IS THAT?
